<Base title="About & how we rank" description="aiphonecompare is the independent, verified price comparison for AI receptionists: every price sourced and dated, sponsored spots labeled, rankings not for sale.">
  <article class="wrap prose page-intro">
    <h1>About aiphonecompare &amp; how we rank</h1>
    <p class="lead">aiphonecompare is the independent, verified price comparison for AI receptionists.</p>
    <h2>Independent</h2>
    <p>We are not owned by any vendor. Tables are alphabetical, and we don't score vendors yet. Sponsored listings may appear first and always carry a <span class="badge">Sponsored</span> label. Rankings are not for sale, and payment never changes a vendor's data.</p>
    <h2>Verified</h2>
    <p>Every price comes from the vendor's own website or a cited source, shown on the vendor's page with the date we last checked it. If we can't verify something, we leave it blank. We never guess prices.</p>
    <h2>By industry</h2>
    <p>Dental practices, law firms and plumbers need different things, like PMS write-back and a signed BAA, intake and Clio sync, or after-hours emergency routing. Each industry page compares only the tools that serve it, with a short buying guide.</p>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>Vendors can ask us to confirm or correct their listing. We update it once we can verify the change against a public source.</p>
    <h2>For vendors</h2>
    <p>Listed vendors can add a free <a href="/badge/">"Listed on aiphonecompare" badge</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
